Package: oh-my-posh
Architecture: amd64 arm64 armhf
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: A prompt theme engine for any shell
 oh-my-posh is a custom prompt engine for any shell that has the ability to
 adjust the prompt string with a function or variable — bash, zsh, fish,
 PowerShell, cmd and more. This package includes the oh-my-posh binary and
 all built-in themes under /usr/share/oh-my-posh/themes.
